#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:85
msgid "Enables the maximum level of optimizations for improved page speed scores. Some of them need an online generation service, which is not included in this plugin, and those have no effect."
msgstr "Omogućuje maksimalnu razinu optimizacija za bolje rezultate brzine stranice. Neke od njih zahtijevaju uslugu generiranja na mreži, koja nije uključena u ovaj dodatak, i one nemaju učinka."

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:92
msgid "Zinn® Cache Engine Standard Presets"
msgstr "Standardne postavke za Zinn® Cache Engine"

#: tpl/presets/standard.tpl.php:96
msgid "Use an official LiteSpeed-designed Preset to configure your site in one click. Try no-risk caching essentials, extreme optimization, or something in between."
